  "stories": {
    "story-1c7399f3-1393-45b8-aa82-2798d6c93d35": {
      "text": "form."
    },
    "story-7913701e-7115-4863-81b9-c5fbf5b63cc2": {
      "text": "A JOURNAL OF SPACE, OBJECT & CULTURE"
    },
    "story-8e2670f7-6eb4-4386-acae-da14796a75bb": {
      "text": "The art of\nless."
    },
    "story-e677947c-28c7-4b73-b58d-cd29d2cef62d": {
      "text": "ISSUE 008   /   AUTUMN 2026"
    },
    "story-14ce4959-6101-4ddb-8b2a-18f5b6f4bd7c": {
      "text": "F O R M    /    ARCHITECTURE"
    },
    "story-332a32be-010a-433c-8939-1e139aefc951": {
      "text": "The shape\nof silence."
    },
    "story-01a935a9-8a36-40b3-bec2-277b257a6273": {
      "text": "A study in light, material, and everything in between."
    },
    "story-ab187ce9-7b58-446f-b944-f924b1daf3eb": {
      "text": "02"
    },
    "story-b236a517-38ef-4fc3-a90a-e4e53114cbc9": {
      "text": "SPACES  /  THE CONSIDERED LIFE"
    },
    "story-abcdbbfb-81a7-4dfd-9ef7-79c0373f84f0": {
      "text": "Less, but\nmore meaning."
    },
    "story-cdeea64b-2c08-41ac-b8e1-7e6e32591342": {
      "text": "In a world that never stops adding, we find\nbeauty in what is left out."
    },
    "story-886b617b-50c7-4024-abdc-3a4c7eb12837": {
      "text": "WORDS BY THE FORM EDITORS"
    },
    "story-869b20b1-ac54-46be-946a-8e35649a12ad": {
      "text": "There is a particular kind of quiet that only architecture can create. Not the absence of sound, but a feeling of having arrived. A pause. A room that asks nothing of you except to be present.\nWe look for it in the places we inhabit: in a wall warmed by the afternoon sun, the generous curve of an arch, the gentle weight of an honest material.\nThese spaces are not empty. They are intentional. Every surface, opening and shadow has been considered, then allowed to breathe. What remains is not less life, but more room for it."
    },
    "story-fe2d066c-99cc-46ba-9b3b-f3bda4ef172e": {
      "text": "01 — A conversation between light and solid form."
    },
    "story-17e1fc55-66bc-45ba-9a39-a1aa528602e6": {
      "text": "FORM JOURNAL"
    },
    "story-1656f750-f1d2-4521-a8e5-02f62c15e8ed": {
      "text": "03"
    },
    "story-b33e265d-ac1b-47f5-9327-8eab1e34eb60": {
      "text": "OBJECTS  /  MATERIAL MATTERS"
    },
    "story-fe17586a-1283-4012-a35b-c3c9488f2a56": {
      "text": "Built to\nbelong."
    },
    "story-094627c8-6886-4252-9e62-ebe5c19b8f7d": {
      "text": "“A building should feel as though\nit has always been there.”"
    },
    "story-de942a74-0524-41b9-bcf5-a33b77e16fad": {
      "text": "04"
    },
    "story-79ffcd3b-6ecd-44a2-81c7-ae3772911925": {
      "text": "ESSAY  /  AN ARCHITECTURE OF CARE"
    },
    "story-5fd948af-383a-4e6d-8a1e-6ecb4b4105f7": {
      "text": "A slower\nway of seeing."
    },
    "story-656db405-4e77-4531-a5c4-ce313d98ed43": {
      "text": "There is a particular kind of quiet that only architecture can create. Not the absence of sound, but a feeling of having arrived. A pause. A room that asks nothing of you except to be present.\nWe look for it in the places we inhabit: in a wall warmed by the afternoon sun, the generous curve of an arch, the gentle weight of an honest material.\nThese spaces are not empty. They are intentional. Every surface, opening and shadow has been considered, then allowed to breathe. What remains is not less life, but more room for it.\nThere is a particular kind of quiet that only architecture can create. Not the absence of sound, but a feeling of having arrived. A pause. A room that asks nothing of you except to be present.\nWe look for it in the places we inhabit: in a wall warmed by the afternoon sun, the generous curve of an arch, the gentle weight of an honest material.\nThese spaces are not empty. They are intentional. Every surface, opening and shadow has been considered, then allowed to breathe. What remains is not less life, but more room for it."
    },
    "story-f904e800-3efd-4f7c-9912-517c13a597ac": {
      "text": ""
    },
    "story-f930f37e-2e35-4337-ae0d-bc3cc9478efa": {
      "text": "05"
    },
    "story-6b49cab2-193d-4247-89ce-56e03acab72d": {
      "text": "form."
    },
    "story-c14f8a1f-1734-4d8c-99c4-e0b5e2bdd7ad": {
      "text": "Good spaces.\nBetter stories."
    },
    "story-a652209a-22ee-45f7-be72-ca90ca8aee97": {
      "text": "INDEPENDENT PERSPECTIVES. CONSIDERED DESIGN."
    }
  },
